{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:38:18.644709+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 80, "evidence_quote": "今天数字化的人民币 和国民党的最后离开大陆的金银券 一模一样 就是没有啥也没有", "evidence_start_char": 41, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v4-forced-retry", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20210706_001_SEG_000004_001", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 1, "point_text": "数字化人民币与国民党的金银券类似，但没有实物支持。", "point_type": "context", "segment_id": "LIVE_20210706_001_SEG_000004", "significance": "对比了当前数字货币与历史货币的不同。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
